d 'EMLINK': module to perform probabilistic record linkage (Fellegi-Sunter) with unsupervised EM estimation
d
d    emlink assumes the comparison variables have already been
d normalized.  The command does not clean strings for you. Accents,
d    mixed case, digits and stray punctuation create artificial
d disagreements that the EM reads as evidence against a match, so  
d  normalization must happen first {bf:and must use identical rules
d in both files}. A file that keeps accents linked against one	 
d that strips them will link badly no matter how the model is
d specified. 
d
d KW: data managemnet
d KW: linking
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260909
d
d Author:  Mario Anderson Apaza Ñaupa,  NA
d Support: email   rioma310@@gmail.com
d
f emlink.ado
f ../_/_emlink_split.ado
f emlink.sthlp
f emlink_engine.mata
f emlink_test.do
